  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Apoio ao MASC para Refor&amp;#231;o das Capacidades do Minist&amp;#233;rio de Planifica&amp;#231;&amp;#227;o e Desenvolvimento</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Through the implementation of this action, MASC will further strengthen its institutional capacity to support public institutions and nationally-led development processes in Mozambique. The specific objective is to strengthen the technical, organisational and coordination capacities of the MPD through targeted institutional support, capacity development interventions and the promotion of inclusive dialogue on national development priorities.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
